# Tor Relay Configuration for Raspberry Pi 5

Nickname RandomRelay778
ContactInfo none@none.com

# Relay ORPort (must match Terraform ports block)
ORPort 9001

# Disable SOCKS (not a client)
SocksPort 0

# Non-exit relay (safe at home!)
ExitPolicy reject *:*

# Bandwidth limits (5 MB/s sustained, 10 MB/s burst)
RelayBandwidthRate 5 MB
RelayBandwidthBurst 10 MB
